    "mapped_at": "2026-10-15",
    "university_id": "sch_khaais",
    "how_to_use": "Run data-import/import-next-unis.mjs muls (--local / --remote, then --apply): it reads data-import/next-unis/unis/muls/data and this file, matches rows by natural key first, upserts by id and never deletes. Rows missing here get a UUID derived from the dataset id, so every database gets the same id.",
    "score_check_values": {
      "one_minimum": "one minimum on the combined score (secondary_cut_off_score null): w1·exam1 + w2·exam2 ≥ cut_off_score; СЭЗИС weights 0.5/0.5 = the average of the two exams",
      "per_exam": "each exam has its own minimum (cut_off_score, secondary_cut_off_score; 0 = unknown); weights 1/1 when the formula is not published, so the page shows a plain sum",
      "skills_test": "group 2 is the university's own skills test: only the group 1 minimum can be checked, otherwise \"Сургуулиас тодруулна уу\"",
      "neutral": "no exam subjects or cut-offs (unclear / unknown split, or an extra subject minimum such as Математик ≥ 600): \"Сургуулиас тодруулна уу\", rule in exam_note"
